      'Our aim is not to make the curtain look new. We secure original paint and add colour only where a white loss distracts from the image; the added material must be removable by a future conservator.',
      'Will visitors be able to see the curtain after restoration?',
      'Yes, but it will hang only for three months each year behind filtered glass. A digital projection will show it during the other months, and the original will rest rolled around a wide tube rather than folded.',
