      'Was finding suppliers willing to share this information easy?',
      'The cotton farm already kept detailed records, but two factories refused our request. We chose a smaller workshop that published wage ranges and allowed an independent safety inspection.',
      'Does more responsible production always make clothing much more expensive?',
      'Our jacket costs about twelve percent more than the previous model. We reduced the difference by using one colour and keeping the same design for two seasons instead of following every short trend.',
      'How should customers care for the jacket, and what happens if it is damaged?',
